        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Múk xafay'ín gu tleéhh bihhaá da/aáw amoodá' tsee/aamá niwa ti'imiiti, a bohhudaá dír bendeérár tlahhoó Yuda. Geeraharusmoó tlahhoó Yuda a Nashoni garmoó Aminadabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boohharós adoodá' kara faari a hhawaate kume mibeeri faanqw nee tsiyáhh nee tsiire lahhoó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk xafay'ín gu tleéhh alaá tlahhoó Yuda a tlahhoó Isakari. Geeraharusmoó tlahhoó Isakari a Netaneli garmoó Suari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boohharós adoodá' kara faari, a hhawaate kume mibeeri kooán nee tsiyáhh nee tsiire tsiyáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy tlahhoó aluudá' gi haár tay oo Sebuluni. Geeraharusmoó tlahhoó Sebuluni a Eliabu garmoó Heloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boohharós adoodá' kara faari a hhawaate kume mibeeri kooán nee faanqw nee tsiire tsiyáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faarór múk dír xaftá Yuda ar adoodá' bohhuuín i diri'iia, dinkwaaro a kume tsiiruú wák mibeeri dakaát nee lahhoó' nee tsiire tsiyáhh. Mukwí an oo hháw geera tleemuú baraá aaiwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
