              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Múk xafay'ín gu tleéhh bihhaá basa a bohhuudá' dír bendeérár tlahhoó Reubeni. Geeraharusmoó tlahhoó Reubeni a Elisuri garmoó Shedeuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boohharós adoodá' kara faari a hhawaate kume mibeeri tsiyáhh nee lahhoó' nee tsiire kooán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk xafay'ín gu tleéhh alaá tlahhoó Reubeni a tlahhoó Simeon. Geeraharusmoó tlahhoó Simeon a Shelumieli garmoó Suri-shadai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boohharós adoodá' kara faari a hhawaate kume mibeeri kooán nee gwaleél, nee tsiire tám. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy tlahhoó aluudá' tay Gadi. Geeraharusmoó tlahhoó Gadi a Eliasafu garmoó Reueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boohharós adoodá' kara faari a hhawaate kume mibeeri tsiyáhh nee kooán nee tsiire lahhoó' nee mibeeri kooán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faarór múk dír xaftá Reubeni adoodá' bohhuuín i diri'iia, dinkwaaro a kume tsiiruú wák nee mibeeri kooán nee wak, nee tsiire tsiyáhh nee mibeeri kooán. Mukwí an oo hháw tsár tleemuú baraá aaiiwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.16"
            ]
